ShadowLeaves:
CAM1 ShadowFigure
Text(0x922)
MOVE 60 ShadowFigure [15,6]
ENUN
STAL 40
MOVE 60 ShadowFigure [15,5]
ENUN
CLEN ShadowFigure
Text(0x924)
STAL 20
NoFade
ENDA

BensonAppears:
CHECK_EVENTID 11
BNE 3 sC s0
//if the flag is ON, go to LABEL 3 and delay Benson's AI, otherwise keep reading
CAM1 [4,13]
STAL 20
LOAD1 0 BensonCrew
ENUN
SVAL s1 0x02
SET_HP Benson
UseVulnerary(Benson,25)
ASMC 0x80790A5 //to end MMS of vulnerary use
CUMO Benson
STAL 60
CURE
Text(0x90D)
STAL 5
CAM1 Daphne
STAL 10
Text(0x909)
GOTO 4
LABEL 3
CAM1 [4,13]
STAL 20
LOAD1 0 BensonCrew
ENUN
SVAL s1 0x02
SET_HP Benson
UseVulnerary(Benson,25)
ASMC 0x80790A5 //to end MMS of vulnerary use
CUMO Benson
STAL 60
CURE
Text(0x926)
STAL 5
CAM1 Daphne
STAL 10
Text(0x909)
SVAL s1 0x00001200
CHAI Benson
SVAL s1 0x00001200
CHAI [9,16]
LABEL 4
NoFade
ENDA

MorrisYells:
